### ===========================
### ANALYTICS MODULE
### ===========================

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Dashboard geral (ADMIN ou INSTITUTION)
###    Retorna: total de estudantes, empresas, desafios,
###    submissões, score médio e top 10 estudantes.
### -------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base_url}}/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Dashboard como Instituição
### -------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base_url}}/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{institution_token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Tentar acessar dashboard como Student (deve retornar 403)
### -------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base_url}}/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
